WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Twelve minutes is a manageable amount of time.
That's a practical reason to try a short routine.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
But an audio format is not the same thing
as scientific proof of its promised benefits.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Zen12 describes twelve-minute sessions
and several listening styles. Those are seller-described features.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Independent research on binaural beats is mixed.
It does not validate a claim about this particular product.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Start with a free twelve-minute practice.
Notice whether the routine fits your life.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Then review the evidence, exact checkout
and refunds before considering any paid option.
